' The web Studio's "project file picked alone" fixture (WEB-OPEN): a
' project of three files, three forms in ui.rr, a desktop-only component
' in globals.rr. File > Open in a browser gives Studio Kiosk.rrproj only;
' Studio offers the project's folder. Opened by the flows, never run.
$APPTYPE GUI
$INCLUDE "globals.rr"
$INCLUDE "ui.rr"

Port = 8080
MainForm.ShowModal
